B.Cb=new A.a0(B.mm,["Tasks are managed securely on the platform.","QueueGo MX","QueueGo MX connects people who need line-waiting help with Runners in Guadalajara.","Post a task or join as a Runner. Pilot project in Guadalajara.","Choose language","Post a task","I want to be a Runner","Admin","Post a request and get support in line","Find available tasks and earn money by helping","Available tasks","Review open tasks and take only the ones you can complete.","Administration panel","Admin Console","Terms","Terms of use","Privacy","Privacy","Create","My Tasks","Publish Task","Fill in task details","Location","Location text or map link","Location","Task description","On-site instructions","Instructions","Start date","Start time","Estimated task duration (hours)","I can arrive within X hours after notification","Urgency level","Normal","Priority","Urgent","Service base (MXN)","Price you are willing to pay (MXN)",u.L,"Enter the amount you are willing to offer.","Price cannot be lower than 250 MXN.","Prices are automatically rounded to the nearest 10 MXN.","Select a date","Publish","Task published.","This field is required","Enter a valid number","Please complete all fields.","You are not signed in.","Saving...","Load failed","Failed to load data. Please try again.","Status","No completed tasks yet.","Available Tasks","Accept","Task accepted.","Apply for task","Submit application","Application submitted.","You have already applied for this task","My applications","My offer (MXN, optional)","Message (optional)","Accept original price","Cancel task","Task cancelled.","Current mode","Customer","Runner","Admin","The current role is an operation mode, not formal identity verification. A full account verification flow will be added later.","No applications yet.","Task ID","Applicants","No applicants yet.","Accept","Reject","Application accepted.","Application rejected.","Cancel","{count} applicants","Active Tasks","Completed","No open tasks right now.","No active tasks right now.","Start date","Start time","Estimated task duration","Can arrive in (hours) after notification","Total price offered","Open location","Price","I have arrived","Arrival check-in","On-site note","Upload image","Image selected","Save arrival update","Arrival details submitted.","Update progress","Example: now #5 in queue","Photo URL (optional)","Paste an image URL","Progress updated.","Progress photo","I am almost at the counter","I am almost at the counter","Customer prep reminder sent.",u.C,"Handoff code","Handoff code","Handoff code: {code}","Give this code to the runner during handoff. The task can only be completed after the runner enters the correct code.","Handoff code has not been generated yet","Generate handoff code","Handoff code generated.","Enter handoff code to complete","Enter handoff code to complete","Ask the customer for the handoff code. Enter it to complete the task.","Enter handoff code, e.g. 491628","Verify & complete","Incorrect handoff code. Task cannot be completed.","Task marked as completed.","Task marked as completed.","Arrived on-site","Update progress","Rate user","Cancel task","Task completed","Arrived at","Ready for handoff at","Completed at","Completed","Reference case","Completed task","Price paid","Reference payment","Estimated payment","Task time","Wait time","Time saved","Level","Prices depend on work time, wait time, and urgency.\nMore urgent tasks or long lines cost more.","Customer rating","Runner rating","Cancelled at","Please share this code with the runner during handoff.","The assigned runner has arrived on site.","The assigned runner is almost at the front. Please prepare to arrive.","The assigned runner has notified you to prepare.","Your stated arrival time: {hours} hours","Task messages","For safety and protection, please communicate inside the platform. Do not exchange private contact details or complete deals outside the platform.","Type a message","Request WhatsApp contact","We recommend using platform messages first. If both sides agree, you may exchange WhatsApp.","Please complete handoff inside the platform to avoid off-platform transactions.","Check-in photo","Latest progress","Propose counter-offer","Runner proposed total (MXN)","Submit counter-offer","Counter-offer submitted.","Runner counter-offer","Original total price","Accept counter-offer","Reject counter-offer","Rate task taker","Rate task publisher","Comment (optional)","Submit review","Review submitted","Trust score: {score}","\u2b50 {avg} ({count} ratings)","Trusted user","Please review rating history","Please select a rating from 1 to 5","You already rated this task","open","negotiating","accepted","pending","rejected","arrived","in_progress","waiting_for_customer","completed","cancelled","Login","Logout","Logged out.","Login status","Login method","Anonymous","Email","Google","Unknown","Current user: Anonymous user {uid}","Current user: {email}","Login","Email","Password","Login","Continue with Google","Register","Continue browsing","Please login with Email/Password to perform this action.","Legacy task without a formal account binding","Administration panel","Create demo tasks","Delete demo tasks","Regenerate demo prices",u.F,"Created {count} demo tasks.","Deleted {count} demo tasks.","Regenerated prices for {count} demo tasks.","Delete task","Are you sure you want to delete this task? This action cannot be undone.","Task deleted successfully.","Failed to delete task. Please try again.","Authentication error","Continue to use QueueGo","It only takes 30 seconds. We do not ask unnecessary information.","Incorrect password","This email is not registered","Account created successfully","Could not sign in","Logged in successfully","Admin login successful","QueueGo MX is a peer-to-peer connection platform.","Only post tasks allowed by the location. Do not share sensitive documents, passwords, or banking data.","Before accepting, confirm you can complete the task safely and legally. Do not accept illegal or suspicious tasks.",u.P,"QueueGo MX only connects users for logistical support in lines and waiting situations. We do not provide official procedures, legal representation, medical decisions, or handling of sensitive documents.",u.b,"Do not share passwords, banking data, sensitive documents, or medical information. For official procedures, the customer must appear in person when required.",u.m,"This service is only to hold a place or support in line. It does not replace the account holder when the institution requires personal presence.","Suspicious risk indicators"],t.w)
